      "text": "🇩🇪Die ersten 6 Tage nach Co2 Laserbehandlung 💫😲🇹🇷6 Günde iyileşme sürecim 💫@hautarztlaserzentrum.deFragen?  #co2laser #haut #akneizleri #fraksiyonellazer#fraktionierterlaser #aknenarbebehandlung #heilungsverlauf#skinhealing #acnescars #acnescarsjourney #acnescarhealing #healingjourney #acnecommunity #acnepositivity #skinprogress #beforeandafter #healingprogress #skincarejourney #acneawareness #trusttheprocess #realrecovery #selfhealing #daybyday #skincareroutine #confidencejourney #naturalhealin",
